;Normal sale, assumes already logged in
Alias ScanField 90 674 ;2429320
Alias dialog 506 366

Assert color 90 15 #000080 ;ensures someone is logged in

MouseClick ScanField ;barcode entry field

TypeText 9412345678901 ;check digit incorrect
PressKey Enter
Sleep 500

;shows dialog 
Assert Memo dialog "Barcode check digit is invalid Barcode 9412345678901 Please try again"
ClickButton formDlg Ok

